title: "One-Person Unicorn: An Agent-Based Architecture for Automated Financial Services"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for an agent-based architecture for automated financial
  services, evaluated across GPT/o-series, Claude, Grok, DeepSeek and Llama on
  cost, latency and output reliability.
